---
import Container from "../ui/Container.astro";
import TextLink from "../ui/TextLink.astro";
---

<section class="company-positioning section-space">
  <Container class="company-positioning__grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Independent by design</p>
      <h2 class="section-heading">
        Senior accountability from the first conversation.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="company-positioning__content">
      <p class="body-large">
        LKProfessionals began in Jaffna in 2013 with a straightforward
        principle: businesses deserve reliable technical work and honest
        ownership of the outcome.
      </p>

      <p>
        We remain intentionally hands-on. Strategy is connected to delivery,
        technical decisions are explained plainly, and responsibility does
        not disappear behind layers of account management.
      </p>

      <p>
        This model allows us to support organisations locally and
        internationally while preserving the standards and direct working
        relationships on which the company was built.
      </p>

      <TextLink href="/about" label="About LKProfessionals" />
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>

<style>
  .company-positioning {
    background: var(--colour-ink);
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
  }

  .company-positioning__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(18rem, 0.65fr);
    gap: clamp(3rem, 9vw, 9rem);
  }

  .company-positioning .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    color: #f58a60;
  }

  .company-positioning .section-heading {
    color: var(--colour-white);
  }

  .company-positioning__content {
    display: grid;
    align-content: end;
    gap: 1.4rem;
  }

  .company-positioning__content p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .company-positioning__content .body-large {
    color: var(--colour-white);
  }

  .company-positioning :global(.text-link) {
    width: fit-content;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    color: var(--colour-white);
  }

  @media (max-width: 50rem) {
    .company-positioning__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
